#.vscode/

# Flutter/Dart/Pub related (workspace root: patterns apply to every package)
**/doc/api/
**/ios/Flutter/.last_build_id
.dart_tool/
.flutter-plugins-dependencies
.pub-cache/
.pub/
build/
coverage/

# Symbolication related
app.*.symbols

# Obfuscation related
app.*.map.json

# Android Studio will place build artifacts here
android/app/debug
android/app/profile
android/app/release
android/key.properties

# Widget Preview related
.widget_preview/

# 真机 UI 取证产物（截图与几何 dump），不入库
packages/diting_shared/tool/uiprobe/

# 多轮 ADB 实测的截图、UI dump 与 VM Service 驱动脚本，不入库
.tmp_verify/
